# (`while grep -q '^agent.spawned.${next_idx}='`), never alias:name — so two
# registrations CAN share one display ref. live_agents is keyed by ref, so the last pane
# wins: both roster entries would show that pane's verdict and killing one pane would
# NOT render its slot ✖, defeating this slice's whole point. Route by SLOT (the
